# Raw, full-resolution source photo uploads — reference-only, never served.
# The resized/compressed copies that the site actually loads live in images/parts/
# and ARE tracked. See CLAUDE.md, "Product photo pipeline" and "Reference material
# vs. served assets". These folders total ~275 MB straight from the camera; keeping
# them out of the repo is what stops a static deploy shipping them.
# (Folder name "Autoconor" is a typo in the folder itself — it holds Autoconer photos.)
images/Autocoro/
images/Autoconor/
images/Ringframe/
images/Rotors/
images/Twin Disc/

# OS / editor cruft
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Throwaway copies of index.html used to force a state for a headless-Chrome
# screenshot (see CLAUDE.md) — these must never be committed.
index.screenshot*.html
